		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Green-grey, feral-looking fey with sharp teeth, wearing a dead animal as a cloak. Hunt prey by heartbeats.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 25, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +3 (1d4 + horrific critical), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Horrific Critical</strong>. If critical hit reduces target to 0 HP, CON 15+ or sangoi tears target's heart out and gobbles it.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sunlight Transparency</strong>. Becomes invisible in sunlight, but cannot take actions, only move.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
